\s1 The Birth and Adoption of Moses
\r \ref Acts 7:20–22|ACT 7:20-22\ref*; \ref Hebrews 11:23|HEB 11:23\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb |וַיֵּ֥לֶךְ\rb* \rb Now a man|אִ֖ישׁ\rb* \rb of the house|מִבֵּ֣ית\rb* \rb of Levi|לֵוִ֑י\rb* \rb married|וַיִּקַּ֖ח\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb a Levite|לֵוִֽי׃\rb* \rb woman,|בַּת־\rb* \v 2 \rb and she|הָאִשָּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb conceived|וַתַּ֥הַר\rb* \rb and gave birth to|וַתֵּ֣לֶד\rb* \rb a son.|בֵּ֑ן\rb* \rb When she saw|וַתֵּ֤רֶא\rb*\rb |אֹתוֹ֙\rb* \rb that|כִּי־\rb* \rb he was a|ה֔וּא\rb* \rb beautiful child,|ט֣וֹב\rb* \rb she hid him|וַֽתִּצְפְּנֵ֖הוּ\rb* \rb for three|שְׁלֹשָׁ֥ה\rb* \rb months.|יְרָחִֽים׃\rb*
