\s1 Setting Up the Tabernacle
\r \ref Acts 7:44–47|ACT 7:44-47\ref*; \ref Hebrews 9:1–10|HEB 9:1-10\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses,|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 2 \rb “On the first|בְּאֶחָ֣ד\rb*\rb |לַחֹ֑דֶשׁ\rb* \rb day|בְּיוֹם־\rb* \rb of the first|הָרִאשׁ֖וֹן\rb* \rb month|הַחֹ֥דֶשׁ\rb* \rb you are to set up|תָּקִ֕ים\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the tabernacle,|מִשְׁכַּ֖ן\rb* \rb the Tent|אֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting.|מוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \v 3 \rb Put|וְשַׂמְתָּ֣\rb* \rb the ark|אֲר֣וֹן\rb* \rb of the Testimony|הָעֵד֑וּת\rb*\f + \fr 40:3 \ft That is, \fqa the ark of the covenant\ft ; also in verses 5 and 21\f* \rb in it|שָׁ֔ם\rb*\rb |אֵ֖ת\rb* \rb and screen|וְסַכֹּתָ֥\rb* \rb off|עַל־\rb* \rb the ark|הָאָרֹ֖ן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb with the veil.|הַפָּרֹֽכֶת׃\rb* \v 4 \rb Then bring in|וְהֵבֵאתָ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the table|הַשֻּׁלְחָ֔ן\rb* \rb and set out|וְעָרַכְתָּ֖\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb its arrangement;|עֶרְכּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb bring in|וְהֵבֵאתָ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the lampstand as well,|הַמְּנֹרָ֔ה\rb* \rb and set up|וְהַעֲלֵיתָ֖\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb its lamps.|נֵרֹתֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
