\s1 The Cloud and the Glory
\r \ref Numbers 9:15–23|NUM 9:15-23\ref*)
\p \v 34 \rb Then the cloud|הֶעָנָ֖ן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb covered|וַיְכַ֥ס\rb* \rb the Tent|אֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting,|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb and the glory|וּכְב֣וֹד\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb filled|מָלֵ֖א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the tabernacle.|הַמִּשְׁכָּֽן׃\rb* \v 35 \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֗ה\rb* \rb was unable|וְלֹא־\rb*\rb |יָכֹ֣ל\rb* \rb to enter|לָבוֹא֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb the Tent|אֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting|מוֹעֵ֔ד\rb* \rb because|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the cloud|הֶעָנָ֑ן\rb* \rb had settled|שָׁכַ֥ן\rb* \rb on it,|עָלָ֖יו\rb* \rb and the glory|וּכְב֣וֹד\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb filled|מָלֵ֖א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the tabernacle.|הַמִּשְׁכָּֽן׃\rb*
\p \v 36 \rb Whenever the cloud|הֶֽעָנָן֙\rb* \rb was lifted|וּבְהֵעָל֤וֹת\rb* \rb from|מֵעַ֣ל\rb* \rb above the tabernacle,|הַמִּשְׁכָּ֔ן\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb would set out|יִסְע֖וּ\rb* \rb through all|בְּכֹ֖ל\rb* \rb the stages of their journey.|מַסְעֵיהֶֽם׃\rb* \v 37 \rb If|וְאִם־\rb* \rb the cloud|הֶעָנָ֑ן\rb* \rb was not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb lifted,|יֵעָלֶ֖ה\rb* \rb they would not|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb set out|יִסְע֔וּ\rb* \rb until|עַד־\rb* \rb the day|י֖וֹם\rb* \rb it was taken up.|הֵעָלֹתֽוֹ׃\rb* \v 38 \rb For|כִּי֩\rb* \rb the cloud|עֲנַ֨ן\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֤ה\rb* \rb was over|עַֽל־\rb* \rb the tabernacle|הַמִּשְׁכָּן֙\rb* \rb by day,|יוֹמָ֔ם\rb* \rb and fire|וְאֵ֕שׁ\rb* \rb was|תִּהְיֶ֥ה\rb* \rb in the cloud|בּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb by night,|לַ֖יְלָה\rb* \rb in the sight|לְעֵינֵ֥י\rb* \rb of all|כָל־\rb* \rb the house|בֵּֽית־\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb through all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb their journeys.|מַסְעֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*
